    "content": "<p>Attention, Pilots! The following patch will be deployed for War Robots: Frontiers following a short period of maintenance on September 30, 2025.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>The new Intel Discount Event has launched (September 30 &ndash; October 7).\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li>Ares, Anansi, Lancelot and Alpha, along with their gear and weapons, now have reduced Intel upgrade costs.</li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>Solidus Node: Foundry&nbsp;has been added back to the map roster for all game modes via a separate unranked queue.</li>\r\n\t<li>Bronze and Silver League players can now be matched with each other in matchmaking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Need help? Contact our <a href=\"https://support.my.games/wrf_int\">Support team</a> to report any issues you&rsquo;re facing on the Wild Ten. Join the official <a href=\"https://wrfrontiers.com/l/discord\">Discord server</a> to get more of the latest news like this.</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"gtx-trans\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 145px; top: 70.0417px;\">\r\n<div class=\"gtx-trans-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>",
